menu "Candis BLE scan example"

config CANDIS_BLE_SCAN_PEER_UUID
    string "Optional peer's 128-bit Service Data UUID"
    default ""
    help
        Enter a canonical UUID such as 01234567-89ab-cdef-0123-456789abcdef.
        The scanner counts advertisements containing Service Data with this
        UUID and reports their strongest RSSI alongside the overall count.

endmenu
